==History==
2025
*The Witch's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 5/5/2025, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/5/2025)|May 2025 Update]] {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 6/5/2025, a maintenance break, decreased the Evolved Witch's overheal hitpoints to 124% (from 125%) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 3/6/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/6/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Witch's healing per [[Skeletons|Skeleton]] defeated by 12% {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 8/7/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/7/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Witch's healing per Skeleton defeated by 12% {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] increased the Evolved Witch's healing per Skeleton defeated by 36% {{Balance|Buff}}, and made it so that can only be healed by defeated Skeletons that she spawns instead of any Skeleton {{Balance|Neutral}}. It also made it so that she can no longer be healed by defeated [[Skeletons/Evolution|Evolved Skeletons]] or [[Guards]] {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]] increased the Skeleton's attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1.0 seconds), and decreased heal per skeleton by 21%.
2026

* On 2/2/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Evolved Witch's heal per skeleton by 11%
* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Evolved Witch's heal per skeleton by 189%, increased her max hitpoints by 40%, increased her overheal ratio to x1.73 (from x1.24), and made it to where she can only be healed by the first 4 skeletons that she spawns.

