==Trivia==
*The Witch is shown to make the practice of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Necromancy necromancy]. Necromancy is a form of magic involving communication with the deceased; either by summoning their spirit as an apparition or raising them bodily.
**In the Japanese language setting of the game, the Witch's name translates to "Necromancer".
*The Witch's Evolution resembles the [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Super_Witch Super Witch] from Clash of Clans.
*The Witch is 1 of 6 evolved [[cards]] associated with [[Skeletons]], with the others being [[Bomber/Evolution|Bomber]], [[Skeleton Barrel/Evolution|Skeleton Barrel]], [[Skeleton Army/Evolution|Skeleton Army]], [[Wall Breakers/Evolution|Wall Breakers]], and of course, [[Skeletons/Evolution|Skeletons]].
*When deployed, the Evolved Witch cackles. When summoning [[Skeletons]], the Evolved Witch may scream or say "''Skeleton!''".
**The Witch is 1 of 9 evolved [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] that speak distinct words when on the field, the others being [[Bomber/Evolution|Bomber]], [[Wizard/Evolution|Wizard]], [[Goblin Cage/Evolution|Goblin Brawler]], [[P.E.K.K.A./Evolution|P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Hunter/Evolution|Hunter]], [[Executioner/Evolution|Executioner]], [[Mega Knight/Evolution|Mega Knight]], and [[Lumberjack/Evolution|Lumberjack]].
***Also, the Witch is 1 of 6 evolved troops whose regular troop do not speak distinct words when on the field, the others being Bomber, Goblin Brawler, Hunter, Executioner, and Mega Knight.
*The Witch's Evolution is the subject of certain cosmetics in the game. More specifically:
**The Witch's Evolution is the subject of 2 [[Emotes]].
**The Witch's Evolution is the subject of a few [[Battle Banners|Battle Banner]] decorations, including an animated one.
*Before the Witch's Evolution's release, the Evolved Witch's healing per Skeleton defeated was decreased by 33%, and her overheal hitpoints were decreased to 125% (from 130%).

